Show a game's settings

Usage: zaun show [OPTIONS] <GAME>

Arguments:
  <GAME>  The game

Options:
      --json        Machine-readable output
  -v, --verbose...  Increase log verbosity (-v debug, -vv trace)
  -h, --help        Print help
